      "text": {
        "jp": "あのなあ……。\r\n陛下との謁見をそんなついでみたいに……。",
        "official_en": "Are you joking? You can’t just waltz into the castle and get an audience with His Majesty.",
        "real_en": "Come on...\r\nYou can’t treat an audience with His Majesty\r\nlike some casual errand..."
