      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ねぇ、レイン。\r\nもう一箇所、案内してほしいところが\r\nあるんだけど、いい？",
        "official_en": "Rain, there is one other place I’d like you to show me. You won’t object, will you?",
        "real_en": "Hey, Rain. There’s one more place I’d like you to show me. Would that be okay?"
